{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"世界傑出華人獎　林廣兆獲崇高榮譽大獎\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CHINA-AWARD-261101-15.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】世界傑出華人獎頒獎典禮在會展舉行。</p><p>立法會主席李慧琼等人作為主禮嘉賓出席典禮。崇高榮譽大獎由中銀國際副董事長林廣兆獲得。</p><p>世界傑出華人獎由世界華商投資基金會主辦，2003年起至今，採取社會推薦，社團、社會賢達和媒體聯合評選方式，選出各行各業具傑出成就的華人。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.030716+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T09:29:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T06:38:55.790559+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:09.091711+00:00","content_hash":"8e896c0bdc939f691be97e493a18267ba436039116746fef68ecf51dfa8a2cb5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.030716+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}